{
    "map": {
        "description": "Converts a feature class or feature layer to a new feature class.",
        "field_mapping.descr": "<xdoc><p>The fields that will be transferred to the output dataset with their respective properties and source fields. The output includes all fields from the input dataset by default.</p><p>Use the field map to add, delete, rename, and reorder fields, as well as change other field properties.</p><p>The field map can also be used to combine values from two or more input fields into a single output field.</p></xdoc>",
        "field_mapping.title": "Field Map",
        "in_features.descr": "The input features that will be exported to a new feature class.",
        "in_features.title": "Input Features",
        "out_features.descr": "The output feature class containing the exported features.",
        "out_features.title": "Output Feature Class",
        "params.category1": "Filter",
        "params.category2": "Fields",
        "params.category3": "Sort",
        "sort_field.descr": "<xdoc><p>The field or fields whose values will be used to reorder the input records and the direction the records will be sorted.</p><p><ul><li>Ascending—Records will be sorted from low value to high value.</li><li>Descending—Records will be sorted from high value to low value.</li></ul></p></xdoc>",
        "sort_field.domain.item2.ASCENDING": "Ascending",
        "sort_field.domain.item2.DESCENDING": "Descending",
        "sort_field.dt.title1": "Field(s)",
        "sort_field.dt.title2": "Order",
        "sort_field.title": "Sort Field",
        "title": "Export Features",
        "use_field_alias_as_name.descr": "<xdoc><p>Specifies whether the input&apos;s field names or field aliases will be used as the output field name.</p><ul><li>Unchecked—The input&apos;s field names will be used as the output field names. This is the default.</li><li>Checked—The input&apos;s field aliases will be used as the output field names.</li></ul></xdoc>",
        "use_field_alias_as_name.title": "Use Field Alias as Name",
        "where_clause.descr": "An SQL expression used to select a subset of features.",
        "where_clause.title": "Expression"
    }
}
